{{Infobox noble|reign-type=[[神武天皇]]の{{ill|Imperial Prince|ja|皇子|vi|Hoàng tử|zh|皇子|ko|황자|lt=Imperial Prince|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Imperial Prince|qq=}}|birth_date=unknown|father={{ill|Kamuyaimimi|en|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kamuyaimimi|qq=}}|name=Takeiwatatsu-no-Mikoto|spouse=Asotsuhime no Mikoto|issue=Hayamikatama no Mikoto
